<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/2nd-century">2nd century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">192 CE</h1><p class="ref-lede">192 CE in world history: 3 events and 3 deaths. 163 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
<nav class="ref-letters yr-near" aria-label="Nearby years"><a href="/years/69">69 CE</a><a href="/years/70">70 CE</a><a href="/years/180">180 CE</a><a href="/years/184">184 CE</a><a href="/years/192" aria-current="page">192 CE</a><a href="/years/212">212 CE</a><a href="/years/217">217 CE</a><a href="/years/220">220 CE</a><a href="/years/222">222 CE</a></nav>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/dong-zhuo" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/dong-zhuo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/may-22">22 May</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Lü Bu kills the warlord Dong Zhuo at the palace gate</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Encouraged by Interior Minister Wang Yun, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lu-bu">Lü Bu</a>, sworn to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dong-zhuo">Dong Zhuo</a> as a son, struck the fatal blow at the palace gate in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/changan">Chang'an</a>. Dong's death is seen as a destabilizing event in the collapse of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/han-dynasty">Eastern Han</a> and a precursor to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/three-kingdoms-period">Three Kingdoms</a> wars.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/han-dynasty">Han Dynasty</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dong-zhuo">Dong Zhuo</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lu-bu">Lü Bu</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/december-31">31 December</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Emperor Commodus is assassinated</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Conspirators including his mistress Marcia and the praetorian prefect had the wrestler Narcissus strangle <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/commodus">Commodus</a> in his bath. The murder ushered in the turbulent Year of the Five Emperors.</p></div></li></ol></section>
