<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/champa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Champa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Champa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Khu Liên, an official at Xianglin, rebels against the Eastern Han dynasty and founds Lâm Ấp, the predecessor state of Champa.</span></li></ul></section>
